    coverage_wrapper_not_retained_keep_artifacts_2026-08-31, 1, "2026-11-03 (tr-cov lane): partially stale. options.keep_artifacts is now plumbed through every live cleanup site (src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/test_runner/test_runner_execute.spl:1162-1388 pass options.keep_artifacts; native_test_cleanup_source_v1 honours it; native_profile.spl forwards --keep-artifacts). One site still hardcodes false: test_runner_execute.spl:1176 (cleanup after a failed preprocessing delete, error path only). Not verifiable without a working coverage native build; keep open pending a run of --keep-artifacts on a failing wrapper."

